    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>Establishing an agriculture project at Tabarjal Governorate, Al Jouf, spanning an area of 72 million square meters, for the cultivation of wheat, vegetables and fruits. It also includes one of the largest olive groves in the world, that comprises 5 million olive trees.</p>\r\n",
